+# Symtropy Documentation Changelog — v2.8
+
+## Added
+
+- meme ecology, humor, living folklore and cultural-agency contract;
+- memetic event extraction, genome and candidate Foundry runtime;
+- meme genome schema;
+- faction, profession, generation and nonhuman humor grammar atlas;
+- mutation, distribution, selection, fatigue, decay, revival and provenance runtime;
+- meme lineage schema;
+- player-specific worldline meme and IRIS private-joke runtime;
+- memetic harm, propaganda, harassment, consent and repair contract;
+- multimodal media, Muse, gesture, architecture and translation runtime;
+- thirty-two-packet meme archaeology and historical mutation anthology;
+- deterministic Firstlight and Continuance benchmark;
+- 100-ticket implementation backlog;
+- benchmark schema and fixture;
+- updated registry, dependency map, roadmap and readiness matrix.
+
+## Direction
+
+v2.8 defines an endless cultural mutation engine rather than an endless content feed:
+
+```text
+world history
+→ situated joke or artifact
+→ real social spread
+→ mutation and conflict
+→ fatigue, revival or folklore
+```
+
+## Evidence Boundary
+
+All capabilities remain D3 / I0 pending implementation, deterministic replay, multiplayer, cultural review, safety review, accessibility, performance and delayed-recall evidence.
