+
+# Canon Registry and Document Governance
+
+## Purpose
+
+Integrate v2.8 meme ecology into the current Symtropy decision spine without allowing generated humor to overwrite world truth, privacy, cultural authorship, or the production priority of Firstlight and the Continuance Crawler.
+
+# v2.8 Ownership
+
+[Meme Ecology, Humor, Living Folklore, and Cultural Agency Contract](./MEME_ECOLOGY_HUMOR_LIVING_FOLKLORE_AND_CULTURAL_AGENCY_CONTRACT_V0_1.md) owns the canonical boundaries for memes, jokes, folklore, cultural ownership, network-grounded spread and Symthaea restraint.
+
+[Memetic Harm, Propaganda, Harassment, Consent, and Repair Contract](./MEMETIC_HARM_PROPAGANDA_HARASSMENT_CONSENT_AND_REPAIR_CONTRACT_V0_1.md) owns harmful use, power, privacy, consent, propaganda, moderation, counter-speech and repair.
+
+[Memetic Event Extraction, Genome, and Candidate Foundry Runtime](../tech/MEMETIC_EVENT_EXTRACTION_GENOME_AND_CANDIDATE_FOUNDRY_RUNTIME_V0_1.md) owns source-event extraction, meme genomes, creator opportunity and deterministic candidate generation.
+
+[Meme Mutation, Distribution, Selection, Decay, and Provenance Runtime](../tech/MEME_MUTATION_DISTRIBUTION_SELECTION_DECAY_AND_PROVENANCE_RUNTIME_V0_1.md) owns spread, mutation, lineage, fatigue, suppression, revival and historical aggregation.
+
+[Player-Specific Worldline Meme, Memory, and IRIS Private Joke Runtime](../tech/PLAYER_SPECIFIC_WORLDLINE_MEME_MEMORY_AND_IRIS_PRIVATE_JOKE_RUNTIME_V0_1.md) owns player specificity, shared-history callbacks, IRIS humor and branch privacy.
+
+[Multimodal Meme Media, Muse, Gesture, Architecture, and Translation Runtime](../tech/MULTIMODAL_MEME_MEDIA_MUSE_GESTURE_ARCHITECTURE_AND_TRANSLATION_RUNTIME_V0_1.md) owns media forms, Muse motifs, gestures, object culture, architecture, accessibility and nonhuman translation.
+
+[Faction, Profession, Generation, and Nonhuman Humor Grammar Atlas](../lore/FACTION_PROFESSION_GENERATION_AND_NONHUMAN_HUMOR_GRAMMAR_ATLAS_V0_1.md) owns authored cultural voices.
+
+[Meme Archaeology, Folklore, and Historical Mutation Anthology](../lore/MEME_ARCHAEOLOGY_FOLKLORE_AND_HISTORICAL_MUTATION_ANTHOLOGY_V0_1.md) owns reference lineages and deep-time cultural packets.
+
+[Meme Ecology Firstlight and Continuance Benchmark](../ops/MEME_ECOLOGY_FIRSTLIGHT_CONTINUANCE_BENCHMARK_V0_1.md) owns promotion evidence.
+
+# v2.8 Core Boundaries
+
+- Memes descend from world events, beliefs, artifacts or prior culture.
+- Spread requires a valid social, media, migration or communications path.
+- Candidate generation does not imply creation, adoption or virality.
+- Most candidates disappear before the player sees them.
+- Cultural voice is layered and may not collapse into universal sarcasm.
+- Generated people remain persistent identities rather than role placeholders.
+- Private jokes remain private until a valid disclosure event.
+- IRIS may use bounded shared-history humor but may not manipulate attachment.
+- Symthaea may curate attention but may not manufacture suffering for content.
+- Harm is evaluated through power, consent, privacy, reach and consequence.
+- Player-specific content remains a minority of surfaced culture.
+- Multimodal memes obey material production, rights and accessibility.
+- Provenance persists even when inhabitants forget or dispute it.
+- No endless engagement feed is part of the canonical experience.
+
+# Canonical Decision Spine
+
+1. [Symtropy Game Constitution v0.6](./SYMTROPY_GAME_CONSTITUTION_V0_6.md)
+2. [Breaking of Firstlight Contract](./BREAKING_OF_FIRSTLIGHT_LOSS_CONTINUITY_AND_PLAYER_AGENCY_CONTRACT_V0_1.md)
+3. [Meme Ecology Contract](./MEME_ECOLOGY_HUMOR_LIVING_FOLKLORE_AND_CULTURAL_AGENCY_CONTRACT_V0_1.md)
+4. [Unique Worldline Cast Runtime](../tech/UNIQUE_WORLDLINE_CAST_GENERATION_IDENTITY_AND_PERSISTENCE_RUNTIME_V0_1.md)
+5. [Mobile Continuance Base Contract](./MOBILE_CONTINUANCE_BASE_HOME_VEHICLE_AND_CREW_SOVEREIGNTY_CONTRACT_V0_1.md)
+6. [Information Ecology Contract](./INFORMATION_ECOLOGY_RUMOR_MEDIA_AND_REPUTATION_CONTRACT_V0_1.md)
+7. [System Interaction and Dependency Map v2.1](./SYSTEM_INTERACTION_AND_DEPENDENCY_MAP_V2_1.md)
+8. [Game Implementation Roadmap v2.1](../ops/GAME_IMPLEMENTATION_ROADMAP_V2_1.md)
+9. [Implementation Readiness Matrix v2.1](../ops/SYMTROPY_IMPLEMENTATION_READINESS_MATRIX_V2_1.md)
+10. [Meme Ecology Benchmark](../ops/MEME_ECOLOGY_FIRSTLIGHT_CONTINUANCE_BENCHMARK_V0_1.md)
+
+# Evidence Boundary
+
+All v2.8 capabilities remain documentation evidence at D3 / I0. Generated jokes, cultural distinction, player recognition, safety, propagation, Muse output and historical mutation remain unimplemented and unverified.
+
+## Registry Maxim
+
+> **Humor joins the canonical simulation only when it remembers who knew what, who made the artifact, how it traveled, who could refuse, and why anyone kept repeating it.**
